<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n30947" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰκον-ικός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>representing a figure, copied from it</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰ. ἄγαλμά τινος</span>
			<i>a portrait</i> statue, <i><span class="en">
				Callix.
				1
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πίνακες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					22.995.8
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Lys.</u>
				1
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὅπλον εἰ.</span> shield
				<i>with</i> embossed <i>portrait,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				IGRom.
				4.144
			</span></i>; of actor's masks, <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				4.148
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>counterfeited, pretended,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				AP
				11.233
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Lucill.
			</span></i>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>belonging to</i> or <i>employing images</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φαντασία</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plot.
					3.6.18
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διάκοσμος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Dam.
					<u>Pr.</u>
					284
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				423
			</span></i> (
				Comp.
			). Adv. -
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κῶς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Procl.
					<u>Inst.</u>
					65
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				<u>in Euc.</u>
				p.16
			</span></i> F., <i><span class="en">
				Dam.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				330
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Simp.
				<u>in Ph.</u>
				160.24
			</span></i>.</div>
